WEBVTT

00:14.070 --> 00:17.010
♪Tear up all the memories of the past♪

00:18.200 --> 00:20.850
♪Let go of all regrets♪

00:20.850 --> 00:26.260
♪I exchange my whole life for a change♪

00:27.730 --> 00:31.280
♪If I decide to let my guard down♪

00:31.830 --> 00:36.120
♪Will I fall for the wrong one♪

00:37.080 --> 00:40.630
♪I dare to give
without fear of destruction♪

00:41.620 --> 00:43.830
♪Love refuses to fall asleep♪

00:43.830 --> 00:46.870
♪I dare to shake heaven and earth♪

00:46.870 --> 00:48.950
♪Even with different paths and goals♪

00:48.950 --> 00:53.010
♪I have no regrets♪

00:53.520 --> 00:58.290
♪Because you're
an unsolvable riddle by fate♪

00:58.290 --> 01:02.580
♪I pray for a miracle♪

01:02.580 --> 01:03.990
♪Over the time♪

01:03.990 --> 01:06.000
♪Even if I'm burned out♪

01:06.000 --> 01:08.850
♪I'm willing to search for the miracle♪

01:08.850 --> 01:12.120
♪Of being with you forever♪

01:12.120 --> 01:16.820
♪I will travel with you all the way♪

01:17.520 --> 01:25.170
♪Love is the most beautiful in life♪

01:37.840 --> 01:43.200
=Sword and Fairy=

01:43.570 --> 01:46.890
=Episode 26=

01:59.479 --> 02:02.830
Miss Shuo Xuan,
now the Bloodbinding has been undone.

02:03.510 --> 02:05.230
Rehai will return
to its wandering orbit.

02:05.830 --> 02:07.400
I wonder if Her Lordship
has a plan in mind.

02:08.070 --> 02:12.510
How are you to know the whereabouts
of Rehai when the time comes?

02:14.430 --> 02:17.640
Stop beating around the bush.
What are you trying to say?

02:20.750 --> 02:23.680
That day, Her Lordship and I together
coerced Ying Xuwei

02:23.680 --> 02:25.520
to hand over the method
to undo the Bloodbinding.

02:26.430 --> 02:28.320
He has long held a grudge against me

02:29.120 --> 02:33.430
but could do nothing to me
because I possessed Rehai.

02:42.280 --> 02:45.280
This scroll records
the trajectory of Rehai.

02:49.870 --> 02:51.400
I've heard the Yu Clan keeps its word.

02:51.960 --> 02:54.550
If you and Her Lordship
are willing to ensure my safety,

02:55.190 --> 02:58.440
I shall certainly reciprocate
and give you the scroll.

03:02.400 --> 03:04.760
What are you two talking about?

03:06.550 --> 03:08.470
I'm just a bit curious.

03:08.470 --> 03:10.550
What does the Yu Clan need Rehai for?

03:11.590 --> 03:14.000
This seems to have nothing
to do with you anymore, right?

03:33.320 --> 03:35.110
I've sensed Qi.

03:37.040 --> 03:41.150
I worry that she might have been hurt
in these past few battles,

03:42.110 --> 03:45.079
so I have brought her back
for a thorough examination.

03:49.510 --> 03:51.079
It's best if it's as you say.

04:10.670 --> 04:13.160
Xuwei, the matter
of Mr. Luo has been settled.

04:14.750 --> 04:16.310
Then bring out the key ring of Rehai.

04:19.160 --> 04:21.720
Your Lordship,
you can verify it for yourself.

04:30.830 --> 04:31.910
Your Lordship...

04:31.910 --> 04:35.830
Your Lordship, we had
an agreement before.

04:37.080 --> 04:39.950
This key ring
is to be guarded by our sect.

04:40.800 --> 04:43.750
Are you planning to break the agreement?

04:59.110 --> 05:02.000
The transaction is complete.
I shall take my leave

05:02.600 --> 05:04.750
Qingfei, see him out.

05:05.930 --> 05:06.950
All right.

05:06.950 --> 05:09.160
The Yujie Hub
is atop the paramount peak.

05:09.160 --> 05:11.310
I do require someone
to escort me down the mountain.

05:12.280 --> 05:15.360
But the flying mechanism of
the Hengdao Sect is not a good choice.

05:17.030 --> 05:20.910
I wonder if you're willing to escort me
down the mountain, Your Lordship?

05:24.190 --> 05:26.800
Your Lordship, we are going down
the mountain anyway.

05:27.440 --> 05:30.880
Why not let Mr. Luo join us?

05:32.360 --> 05:33.360
Thank you, Your Lordship.

06:10.950 --> 06:11.980
Father.

06:31.480 --> 06:32.490
(Father.)

06:36.760 --> 06:37.880
This is not an inner orb,

06:38.630 --> 06:41.320
but a pill refined
from their own energy by a demon.

06:42.720 --> 06:44.040
Which demon is so foolish

06:44.790 --> 06:46.070
(Luo Zhaoyan)
that he gave it to you?

06:47.110 --> 06:48.670
I have made an agreement
with that wolf demon.

06:49.390 --> 06:51.200
He used half of his energy
to save my daughter.

06:51.790 --> 06:54.720
In three months,
I will return to let it devour me.

06:58.000 --> 06:59.020
Maiming.

07:03.510 --> 07:05.920
If this can successfully
prolong Zhaoyan's life,

07:07.320 --> 07:08.510
my death will be worth it.

07:09.790 --> 07:10.830
You have to stand him up.

07:13.760 --> 07:14.800
What does that mean?

07:15.510 --> 07:18.320
The demonic power
in this pill cannot be utilized by me.

07:20.230 --> 07:23.000
It seems that as long as
the condemnation of heaven exists,

07:24.280 --> 07:26.830
I cannot replenish my Vitality Energy
from other sources.

07:28.790 --> 07:31.950
But you can
have Zhaoyan take it and see.

07:32.760 --> 07:34.230
I'm just afraid that until she dies,

07:34.950 --> 07:38.600
this demonic power
will just dissipate in vain.

07:41.070 --> 07:42.550
Jeez, the condemnation of heaven!

07:44.230 --> 07:49.000
Zhaoyan is such a good child.

07:51.000 --> 07:54.440
Luo Wangping, if I tell Zhaoyan

07:55.550 --> 07:59.350
that as a twin of our family,
she is destined to die young

08:01.000 --> 08:03.280
because I stole half her life,

08:04.350 --> 08:06.160
would she be so nice to me?

08:11.880 --> 08:16.280
She regards you
as her most important elder brother.

08:20.070 --> 08:24.080
Don't you have even a bit
of familial affection in your heart?

08:24.630 --> 08:28.550
Familial affection?
After I was first reborn,

08:28.550 --> 08:29.920
I told the elders of the family

08:31.390 --> 08:33.669
Bloodbinding Rehai contravened
the Heavenly Laws

08:34.669 --> 08:37.669
and that we would all suffer from
the condemnation of heaven.

08:38.760 --> 08:41.480
Guess what their reaction was?

08:43.230 --> 08:44.760
To prevent me
from undoing the Bloodbinding

08:45.790 --> 08:48.280
and causing the family to lose
the water supply of Rehai,

08:49.160 --> 08:52.670
the then family master,
my elder brother in my first life,

08:53.630 --> 08:56.390
decisively ordered my execution.

08:59.070 --> 09:01.920
Luo Wangping, you are a smart person.

09:03.200 --> 09:06.350
You can do many things for me,
who cannot leave the mansion.

09:07.830 --> 09:11.550
So far, you've been a good ally.

09:12.920 --> 09:16.670
You can leave.
I will inform you of my new ideas.

09:18.040 --> 09:21.630
I hope we can continue
to cooperate happily.

09:43.880 --> 09:46.630
Zhaoyan.

09:48.790 --> 09:51.670
Stop hiding. I know you're there.

09:54.550 --> 09:56.600
No, I'm not here.

10:02.040 --> 10:04.350
I'm not here.

10:08.230 --> 10:09.260
Zhaoyan.

10:11.200 --> 10:12.200
I'm not here.

10:28.480 --> 10:29.550
How is Zhaoyan doing?

10:33.600 --> 10:34.990
I cast a calming spell on her

10:34.990 --> 10:36.040
to let her sleep well.

10:37.240 --> 10:38.320
Any news about Little Yue?

10:41.360 --> 10:42.600
Judging from the current situation,

10:43.600 --> 10:44.830
they wouldn't harm Qi.

10:46.240 --> 10:50.240
The problem is that no one knows
where the Yujie Hub is.

10:51.830 --> 10:53.480
I also can't sense
the Sea of Clear Skies.

10:54.480 --> 10:57.630
The best option is to wait.

10:58.240 --> 10:59.240
Wait for them to come to me.

11:01.390 --> 11:03.830
Don't worry. We will find Little Yue.

11:06.540 --> 11:07.600
You stay with Zhaoyan.

11:08.160 --> 11:10.480
I'll go look again to see
if there's any sign of Qi.

13:11.160 --> 13:12.200
My master wants to see you.

13:25.600 --> 13:26.600
You dare to come back?

13:33.310 --> 13:37.750
I've returned
because my only kin is here.

13:45.990 --> 13:47.050
Since you can't let go,

13:48.360 --> 13:50.310
you shouldn't have destroyed
the things she cares about.

14:03.560 --> 14:07.800
What? You want to kill me?

14:11.510 --> 14:15.510
For 200 years,
I've been putting up with the misery.

14:16.430 --> 14:20.600
Dying at your hands now
would be a release.

14:24.040 --> 14:25.390
With your current level of skill,

14:27.280 --> 14:29.480
you're merely an ant beneath my feet.

14:29.480 --> 14:33.950
What? Should I thank you for your mercy?

14:43.120 --> 14:44.510
You drove Zhaoyan out of the Luo family

14:45.990 --> 14:47.240
and sent her to the Mangwan Village.

14:48.240 --> 14:51.750
You spared no effort to protect her,
even annihilating the entire family.

14:54.070 --> 14:55.150
Luo Maiming,

14:56.390 --> 14:59.950
should I say you are pitiable
or detestable?

15:18.600 --> 15:23.870
Say it. What is the real reason
you've come to me?

15:29.920 --> 15:30.990
I came here

15:37.920 --> 15:43.990
to confirm whether her choice
was the correct one.

15:59.800 --> 16:04.630
I still can't accept it.

16:18.950 --> 16:20.120
You killed the entire Luo family,

16:21.390 --> 16:22.920
and you don't leave
a single word of remorse?

16:25.430 --> 16:26.430
Remorse?

16:29.390 --> 16:30.830
Between you and me,

16:35.430 --> 16:37.990
I can hardly tell
who's more like a demon.

17:12.920 --> 17:13.960
This place is...

17:49.940 --> 17:50.990
Master.

17:53.390 --> 17:57.040
♪A meteor streaking across the sky♪

17:58.350 --> 18:01.260
♪Burns what once was♪

18:02.420 --> 18:05.520
♪The name is forgotten♪

18:09.360 --> 18:13.100
♪The deep feelings are hidden
behind the mask♪

18:14.350 --> 18:17.320
♪Only through the eyes♪

18:18.190 --> 18:21.130
(To fix someone's mistake...)
♪Who can see them clearly♪

18:23.340 --> 18:30.250
♪I'm destined
to brave all dangers for you♪

18:31.380 --> 18:38.000
♪Even if I cannot escape fate
in the end♪

18:39.410 --> 18:47.310
♪I gave up everything
for a moment of heartfelt resonance♪

18:47.310 --> 18:54.220
♪Leaving love
with an unspoken explanation♪

19:01.900 --> 19:05.870
(To fix someone's mistake,
you need to understand what they think.)

19:11.280 --> 19:15.660
♪The seemingly random paths♪

19:18.200 --> 19:19.280
(Qi)
This is...

19:20.370 --> 19:23.980
♪Behind them are all secrets♪

19:24.630 --> 19:25.870
This is my room.

19:27.380 --> 19:31.540
♪Those unexpected encounters♪

19:32.430 --> 19:36.400
♪Are all carefully♪

19:36.400 --> 19:40.430
(To fix someone's mistake)
♪Arranged by me♪

19:41.300 --> 19:47.950
♪I'm destined
to brave all dangers for you♪

19:49.360 --> 19:56.720
♪Even if I cannot escape fate
in the end♪

19:57.260 --> 20:05.290
♪I gave up everything
for a moment of heartfelt resonance♪

20:05.290 --> 20:12.560
(Thought Sword Techniques)
♪With an unspoken explanation♪

20:13.550 --> 20:20.880
(Li Guang, Dang Tao)
♪I'm destined to give my all for you♪

20:21.480 --> 20:28.810
♪Even if my efforts may go up in smoke♪

20:29.390 --> 20:37.450
♪I am madly in love with you
and will do everything for you♪

20:41.080 --> 20:42.160
Qi.

20:43.990 --> 20:45.390
Only Jinzhao can call me Qi.

20:47.200 --> 20:50.920
But do you know the origin of your name?

21:01.080 --> 21:04.040
At that time, you had just been born.

21:05.800 --> 21:08.110
Xuwei and I went
to the Sea of Clear Skies

21:09.350 --> 21:10.920
to take you
to the Yujie Hub to raise you.

21:27.630 --> 21:28.960
She's so adorable.

21:43.590 --> 21:46.680
We will take her back to the Yujie Hub
and raise her well.

21:49.280 --> 21:53.840
Her name is Qi.

22:16.750 --> 22:18.920
Qi signifies good wishes.

22:19.510 --> 22:21.560
She hoped you'd be happy and safe.

22:26.590 --> 22:28.040
Happy and safe.

22:30.160 --> 22:31.870
I'll take you to a place, okay?

22:59.590 --> 23:01.440
Why did you bring me here?

23:04.840 --> 23:06.960
You have left something here.

23:22.160 --> 23:23.180
These are...

24:48.870 --> 24:50.280
Each star

24:52.230 --> 24:53.920
represents a memory of yours.

25:04.080 --> 25:05.160
So...

25:08.390 --> 25:10.080
You wiped out my memories?

25:15.960 --> 25:16.970
Yes.

25:20.920 --> 25:22.710
You manipulated everything in my life?

25:24.960 --> 25:26.030
Yes.

25:37.680 --> 25:38.730
Am I

25:42.230 --> 25:44.440
a pawn in your game?

25:51.110 --> 25:52.140
Yes.

26:10.710 --> 26:12.160
What on earth do you want?

26:49.320 --> 26:51.840
If you don't tell me,
I'll find out myself.

26:55.470 --> 26:59.400
♪Autumn comes and spring goes.
Eventually they fall♪

27:01.300 --> 27:05.580
♪The sun rises and the moon sets♪

27:06.290 --> 27:10.890
♪Giving you a gentle answer♪

27:14.030 --> 27:16.270
♪Under the sycamore tree♪

27:17.100 --> 27:19.440
♪The raindrops patter♪

27:20.080 --> 27:24.490
♪Breaking off a branch
to exchange for the memories♪

27:25.160 --> 27:27.800
You shouldn't have treated
Huan that way just now.

27:30.960 --> 27:33.160
Even you've learned to eavesdrop.

27:34.870 --> 27:37.800
You only saw Huan's surveillance
and schemes against you.

27:39.040 --> 27:42.710
In fact, he's done a lot for you,
and you just don't know it.

27:43.440 --> 27:44.520
I don't want to know.

27:45.510 --> 27:47.510
He once swore to heaven

27:48.870 --> 27:50.920
that he would absolutely not
use the Resonance Spell on you.

27:51.800 --> 27:54.680
Otherwise, he would suffer
the divine punishment of burning.

27:56.710 --> 28:00.200
But Huan broke his oath twice for you.

28:03.710 --> 28:06.320
The first time was in the Luori Village,

28:07.750 --> 28:09.390
when you were in a deep coma

28:10.040 --> 28:11.370
and it was hard to control your poison.

28:12.490 --> 28:16.200
He immediately used the Resonance Spell
to alleviate your pain.

28:16.200 --> 28:17.290
Qi,

28:19.760 --> 28:21.320
I once swore not to use this spell.

28:24.040 --> 28:26.960
But you're poisoned so deeply.
I have no choice but to do it.

28:50.290 --> 28:56.270
♪I promise you a lifetime
of joy and yearning♪

28:56.270 --> 29:02.380
♪Burying your past
in the hustle and bustle♪

29:02.380 --> 29:07.050
♪I'll accompany you
through ups and downs♪

29:07.560 --> 29:10.200
Physician Bian, thank you
for saving me last night.

29:10.200 --> 29:12.840
You woke up because you had
abundant spiritual energy.

29:13.990 --> 29:14.990
And the second time.

29:16.040 --> 29:19.920
The second time was
at the Qiyuan Sect's headquarters.

29:21.300 --> 29:27.120
♪Being irrational and silly
because of you♪

29:27.120 --> 29:33.260
♪Betting your whole life♪

29:35.280 --> 29:39.040
(He was afraid that I would
lose my mind at that time?)

29:52.630 --> 29:54.960
Jinzhao has sent a letter.
He's waiting for us in the Yinghui Fort.

30:00.630 --> 30:02.800
Let's go there now to meet with him.

30:03.510 --> 30:04.520
Okay.

30:12.080 --> 30:13.320
Who are you?

30:13.320 --> 30:14.410
Are you allies of Luo Zhaoyan?

30:14.920 --> 30:16.630
Where is Luo Zhaoyan? Tell us!

30:16.630 --> 30:17.640
Tell us!

30:17.640 --> 30:18.990
Say it!

30:24.560 --> 30:26.390
You are here for revenge
against Luo Zhaoyan too?

30:27.840 --> 30:30.280
My wife and I returned home
to attend the grand family ceremony.

30:31.350 --> 30:34.840
But my wife was struck by an evil spell
and was greatly weakened.

30:38.110 --> 30:39.200
Those who ran out said

30:39.710 --> 30:41.280
everyone under the evil spell died.

30:41.280 --> 30:42.350
How did she survive?

30:42.990 --> 30:45.800
I've heard Luo Zhaoyan has a twin sister
named Luo Maiming.

30:45.800 --> 30:47.200
Let us see her face.

30:47.200 --> 30:49.230
Yes, have her turn her face
and let us take a look.

30:50.040 --> 30:51.920
Otherwise, we will take matters
into our own hands.

30:51.920 --> 30:53.390
- Right, turn around.
- Turn around.

30:53.390 --> 30:55.390
- Turn around.
- Turn around.

30:56.630 --> 30:57.710
Xian Qing.

31:01.110 --> 31:03.960
Don't be foolish. You didn't kill them.

31:05.560 --> 31:07.280
Someone must give them an explanation.

31:17.200 --> 31:18.220
What's going on?

31:19.750 --> 31:21.630
She really looks like Luo Zhaoyan.

31:21.630 --> 31:23.660
She must be
Luo Zhaoyan's sister, Luo Maiming.

31:24.240 --> 31:25.710
Say it! Where is your brother?

31:28.080 --> 31:29.280
I am Luo Zhaoyan.

31:30.710 --> 31:33.200
I was disguised as a man before,
and there was a reason for it.

31:34.160 --> 31:37.710
I failed to realize and stop
the slaughter in time. I deserve to die.

31:43.470 --> 31:46.470
If my death can appease your hatred,

31:48.110 --> 31:49.230
I will do it.

31:57.200 --> 32:00.750
- Kill her!
- Kill her!

32:00.750 --> 32:01.960
Avenge our clansmen!

32:01.960 --> 32:04.200
- Kill her!
- Kill her!

32:04.200 --> 32:05.200
Avenge our clansmen!

32:05.200 --> 32:07.840
- Kill her!
- Kill her!

32:18.750 --> 32:19.790
Xian Qing.

32:25.040 --> 32:26.090
Stand up.

32:33.560 --> 32:37.680
Zhaoyan, I have indulged
your pride and caprice.

32:39.200 --> 32:40.200
Now it's my willful time.

32:41.280 --> 32:42.320
Xian Qing.

32:48.840 --> 32:50.110
Such a lively scene!

32:54.040 --> 32:57.200
Luo Maiming, how dare you show up?

32:58.680 --> 32:59.920
Luo Maiming.

32:59.920 --> 33:00.990
He is Luo Maiming.

33:01.560 --> 33:02.590
He is Luo Maiming?

33:03.160 --> 33:05.750
The clothes of the person upstairs
did resemble his.

33:06.630 --> 33:08.870
Why bother with details?
Just kill them both.

33:09.470 --> 33:10.840
After all, they are siblings.

33:10.840 --> 33:12.990
They must both be involved
in the bloody case.

33:13.870 --> 33:16.800
If you all can't discern
right from wrong,

33:18.680 --> 33:20.230
let's see.

33:30.800 --> 33:33.560
Did you truly kill
the members of the Luo family?

33:33.560 --> 33:34.630
Was it really all your doing?

33:35.210 --> 33:36.240
Of course.

33:36.840 --> 33:38.590
- It was him.
- You beast!

33:38.590 --> 33:39.660
- He did it.
- He did it.

33:40.390 --> 33:44.800
For dozens of miles around, all rely on
the water source here for survival.

33:45.630 --> 33:47.680
Do you know where this water comes from?

33:50.590 --> 33:52.080
The ancestors of the Luo family

33:52.840 --> 33:56.780
exchanged the early death of Luo's twins
for the inexhaustible water!

33:57.420 --> 33:59.560
- Is what he's saying true?
- What happened?

33:59.560 --> 34:03.110
You're standing on the bones
of the twins without shame,

34:04.200 --> 34:06.440
feasting on their blood

34:06.440 --> 34:08.199
and flesh!

34:09.750 --> 34:11.199
Let me ask you all one question.

34:13.389 --> 34:17.800
Did the twins owe you anything?

34:17.800 --> 34:20.560
Maiming, don't say any more.

34:33.199 --> 34:34.590
You pity them

34:37.110 --> 34:39.080
and are willing to lay down
your life for them.

34:41.840 --> 34:42.840
I am not.

34:46.280 --> 34:48.110
Even if your fates are tragic,

34:48.110 --> 34:49.389
even if you brought the water source,

34:50.080 --> 34:51.080
does that mean you can kill?

34:51.679 --> 34:54.510
Yeah. I don't care
what your reasons are.

34:55.389 --> 34:56.989
I only know blood for blood.

34:58.110 --> 35:01.110
Luo Maiming, you killed the entire clan.

35:02.350 --> 35:03.990
You should repay with your life.

35:04.680 --> 35:07.400
- Right, blood for blood!
- Repay with your life!

35:07.400 --> 35:08.590
- Blood for blood!
- Die for it!

35:08.590 --> 35:09.650
Great.

35:09.650 --> 35:10.760
- Die!
- Die!

35:13.200 --> 35:14.730
Blood for blood.

35:16.320 --> 35:19.040
You didn't repay enough yesterday!

35:22.680 --> 35:23.990
Murderer!

35:44.370 --> 35:46.920
Maiming.

36:06.420 --> 36:09.330
♪Looking back♪

36:10.450 --> 36:13.650
♪I try to bring back memories♪

36:14.540 --> 36:18.450
♪We're connected♪

36:18.450 --> 36:20.720
♪It's meant to be♪

36:22.320 --> 36:25.970
♪I've fallen in love silently♪

36:26.480 --> 36:30.290
♪Years leave no trace behind♪

36:30.290 --> 36:32.530
♪On a moonlight night♪

36:32.530 --> 36:34.510
♪I lapsed into my memories♪

36:34.510 --> 36:37.230
♪About you♪

36:37.230 --> 36:40.530
♪All laughter and joy are about you♪

36:41.230 --> 36:44.620
♪It's unforgettable. It's all about you♪

